WHAT THIS LICENCE COVERS

The MIT licence above applies to the code in this repository: the build and
check scripts, the layout, styling and behaviour written for this redesign, and
the documentation.

It does not, and cannot, cover the following, because they are not the
copyright holder's to license:

  1. ACES branding — the name "ACES", the "Association of Computer Engineering
     Students", the crest, and the blue-and-white identity. These belong to the
     Association of Computer Engineering Students, KNUST.

  2. Photographs — every image under design-source/assets/, including the
     association's own photographs, the club and gallery images, and the
     marketplace product photographs. These belong to ACES, to its
     photographers, and to the individual student vendors who took them.

  3. Personal data — the staff directory, the executive listings, the vendor
     and shop names, and the contact details attached to them. These describe
     real people. They appear here only because ACES already publishes them on
     acesknust.com, and republishing them elsewhere is not granted by this
     licence.

  4. Third-party code — React, vendored under vendor-cache/ and site/vendor/,
     is licensed by Meta under its own MIT licence. support.js and
     image-slot.js are generated by Claude Design and carry their own terms.

If you reuse this project, replace items 1 to 3 with your own before you
deploy anything.
